        "@value": "by substituting for item 55 the following item: Actual monthly wages Total of the month contribution 55. When wages exceed RM20.20 “ RM5,000 but not exceed RM5,100 (b) by inserting after item 55 the following items: Actual monthly wages Total of the month contribution 56. When wages exceed RM20.60 “ RM5,100 but not exceed RM5,200 57. When wages exceed RM21.00 RM5,200 but not exceed RM5,300 58. When wages exceed RM21.40 RM5,300 but not exceed RM5,400 59. When wages exceed RM21.80 RM5,400 but not exceed RM5,500 Actual monthly wages Total Corresponding of the month contribution monthly wages for the month 60. When wages exceed RM22.20 RM5,500 but not exceed RM5,600 61. When wages exceed RM22.60 RM5,600 but not exceed RM5,700 62. When wages exceed RM23.00 RM5,700 but not exceed RM5,800 63. When wages exceed RM23.40 RM5,800 but not exceed RM5,900 64. When wages exceed RM23.80 RM5,900 but not exceed RM6,000 65. When wages exceed RM23.80 ”. RM6,000"
